### DocExtract — retrieval e2e requests
### Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or the IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### Prerequisites: see e2e/README.md

@host = http://localhost:8080
@contextPath = /adeon-docextract
@baseUrl = {{host}}{{contextPath}}
# dvelop-mock's identityprovider-validate.json accepts any bearer token.
@authHeader = Bearer {{$processEnv DMS_TEST_TOKEN}}

@objectDefinitionId = DREC
@propertyId = 15

### Upload a document to obtain a processId for the process-scoped requests below.
# @name uploadLetter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingest/documents
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----docextractE2E

------docextractE2E
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="letter.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./fixtures/letter.txt
------docextractE2E--

### Similar documents already APPROVED for this process (FR-3, NfA-6).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/processes/{{uploadLetter.response.body.$.processId}}/similar-documents
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

### Document type candidate(s) for this process — falls back to the full repository catalog.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/processes/{{uploadLetter.response.body.$.processId}}/document-type-candidates
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

### Full repository catalog of document types/properties, independent of any process.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/object-definitions
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

### A single property's valid values, unfiltered.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/value-lists/{{propertyId}}
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objectDefinitionId": "{{objectDefinitionId}}",
  "extendedProperties": {},
  "multivalueExtendedProperties": {},
  "searchTerm": null
}

### Same property, filtered via searchTerm (frontend typeahead).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/value-lists/{{propertyId}}
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objectDefinitionId": "{{objectDefinitionId}}",
  "extendedProperties": {},
  "multivalueExtendedProperties": {},
  "searchTerm": "Fre"
}

